==German==

===Noun===
'''Votze'''

# Misspelling of ''[[Fotze]]''.

====Usage notes====
* The misspelling is likely due to the fact that ''Fotze'' is an offensive word and is thus not often found in published works.
* The misspelling might also be due to the shape of the letter V reminding people of a vagina, which also starts with the letter v.

